        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Methyl tert-butyl ether, at plant
Rough estimation for this product;
CAS number: 001634-04-4; 
Formula: C5H12O; 
Synonyms: MTBE; 
UUID: ec175545-9fcb-3b0c-9cb4-bccbe584d085
Infrastructure, use of raw materials for production of MTBE. No data for emissions and catalysts. 
Location: Publication in the US.
Technology: Reaction of isobutene with methanol. Reaction temperature 100°C. Catalysts are used.
Time period: Time of publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. 
Extrapolations: From single data to global situation. Use of isobuten approximated with butadiene.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ec175545-9fcb-3b0c-9cb4-bccbe584d085.xml</text>
